@SmartSchool.Website.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Submit Valid Contact Form
POST {{SmartSchool.Website.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contact-submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmed Mohamed",
  "schoolName": "Example International School",
  "phoneNumber": "+966500000000",
  "workEmail": "contact@example.com",
  "message": "We would like to learn more about the platform."
}

### 2. Submit With Optional Message Omitted
POST {{SmartSchool.Website.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contact-submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara Al-Otaibi",
  "schoolName": "Riyadh Excellence Academy",
  "phoneNumber": "+966512345678",
  "workEmail": "sara@excellence.edu.sa"
}

### 3. Invalid Submission (Missing Required Fields & Invalid Email)
POST {{SmartSchool.Website.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/contact-submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "schoolName": "",
  "phoneNumber": "abc",
  "workEmail": "not-an-email"
}
